<title>UK: BFI drifts lower by two points, fixed at 1,511.</title>
<headline>BFI drifts lower by two points, fixed at 1,511.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Holidays in the Far East and post Christmas and New Year lethargy in West kept the freight market off the boil on Friday.</p>
<p>The spot Baltic Freight Index (BFI) was fixed down two at 1,511 in dull conditions.</p>
<p>Brokers said activity is expected to pick-up next week amid fresh enquiry.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8075</p>
